{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/anna_head.png?t=1744661075\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Kitchen waits for no one.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We need quick hands, sharp eyes, and smart moves. If you can throw fast, match fruits, and mess with your rivals\u2014you might have what it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your role. Four characters, each with a special ability. Use it well, or get left behind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different arenas and game modes with each their own gameplay twists, no games are ever the same! (Except the fruits, they don't change much actually, I hope you like apples.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete in intense <strong>PvP</strong> battles or team up in <strong>Coop</strong> modes for a more cozy/puzzle experience for <strong>up to 8 players</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you in the Kitchen, Chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630380/extras/store_asset_violet_head.png?t=1744661075\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630380?t=1744661075","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630380?t=1744661075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea